        "name": "TheChattyDM",
        "username": "TheChattyDM",
        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/t/94ad74/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2015-08-19T12:37:34.000Z",
        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"PlatinumWarlock\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/platinumwarlock/48/1869_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> PlatinumWarlock:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>If you're able to do&nbsp;<em>both</em>, that's fine. &nbsp;The way it was worded earlier, it sounds like it's an 'either/or'. &nbsp;Could we get clarification?</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>You get to tap into your spotlight issues until you hit six issues, then you'd have to trade them.</p>\n<p>As I said, work in progress, in need of further testing. <img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/slight_smile.png?v=12\" title=\":slight_smile:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":slight_smile:\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"></p>",
        "post_number": 171,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T04:18:34.978Z",
