      {
        "id": 141476,
        "name": "dpt",
        "username": "dpt",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/dpt/{size}/1922_2.png",
        "created_at": "2015-08-30T00:10:47.000Z",
        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote group-playtesters\" data-username=\"Matchstickman\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/matchstickman/48/1880_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> Matchstickman:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>\"New\" video!</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=KJ-AcEAPXvQ\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=KJ-AcEAPXvQ</a></p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>Nice interview. There was one tidbit that I had missed earlier: the characters will have more than two principles, and will have two principles active at any one time. That reminds me of the Sentinel Tactics mechanic.</p>",
